message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AgriFuseNet: background-free multi-organ feature fusion for sugarcane variety identification"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24151375
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Tassadaq
    affiliation: "Centre for AI and Big Data and Department of Electrical Engineering, Namal University, Mianwali, Pakistan"
  - family-names: Younis
    given-names: Kamran
    affiliation: "Centre for AI and Big Data, Namal University, Mianwali, Pakistan"
abstract: >-
  Code for background-free multi-organ sugarcane variety identification on the Sugarcane-PK v1.0 dataset:
  text-prompted Segment Anything 3 organ segmentation, a leaf-blade encoder with channel-wise attention fusion of
  masked-blade, vein-resolving tile and botanical descriptors, a permutation-invariant organ-set fusion network
  with organ dropout, leakage groups, capture periods, grouped and session-level evaluation protocols, and
  background shortcut diagnostics.
keywords:
  - sugarcane
  - variety identification
  - multi-organ fusion
  - Segment Anything
  - data leakage
  - shortcut learning
